        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Livery braid consisting of a ribbon woven with looped silk pile, possibly made in England, 19th century"@en , "Livery braid consisting of a ribbon woven with looped silk pile, and on a pale blue ground is a coat of arms of Gado of Traquair and an earl's coronet as a crest. The coronet is woven in red, yellow and white silk.\n\nThe arms are quarterly. First, or, a fess chequy azure and argent (for Stewart); second, azure three gerbs or (for Bucan); third, sable, a mullet argent (for Traquair); fourth, argent, an orle gules, and in chief two martlets azure eyed of the second. This last quarter differs slightly from that quarter of the arms of the Earls of Traquair, which should be: fourth, argent, an orle gules, and in chief three martlets sable beaked of the second (for Rutherford)."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/934a7e1f-c5dd-32f1-b6d2-eb46d3821bd6> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c257f0c4-40f2-3ac3-a92e-a393d536543c> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Livery braid consisting of a ribbon woven with looped silk pile, possibly made in England, 19th century"@en , "Livery braid consisting of a ribbon woven with looped silk pile, and on a pale blue ground is a coat of arms of Gado of Traquair and an earl's coronet as a crest. The coronet is woven in red, yellow and white silk.\n\nThe arms are quarterly. First, or, a fess chequy azure and argent (for Stewart); second, azure three gerbs or (for Bucan); third, sable, a mullet argent (for Traquair); fourth, argent, an orle gules, and in chief two martlets azure eyed of the second. This last quarter differs slightly from that quarter of the arms of the Earls of Traquair, which should be: fourth, argent, an orle gules, and in chief three martlets sable beaked of the second (for Rutherford)."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/fba7f8ee-6744-3e38-9229-dfd2c7c45b16/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/fba7f8ee-6744-3e38-9229-dfd2c7c45b16/dimension/2> ;
